WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,450
Say it

2
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,600
I saw our former university bully Zhang Tong

3
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,000
He didn't even find a job

4
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,200
Now you can drive a shabby four-wheeler on the roadside to sell fruit, right?

5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,600
I don’t believe that a top student is selling fruit. Stop spreading rumors.

6
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,000
Zhang Tong is so strong in professional subjects

7
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,200
It’s only right that big manufacturers rush for medicines

8
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,500
How is it possible to sell fruit?

9
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,800
There are pictures and the truth

10
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,960
Fighting for the big dog's eyes

11
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:19,860
This four-wheeled vehicle looks so professional. It’s so talented.

12
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,260
Such high scores in four years of college

13
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:23,260
In the end, I was reduced to selling fruit, what the hell?

14
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,360
After all, selling fruit is a bottom-level win with no future.

15
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:27,160
When we work in the company, we can change jobs and gain value.

16
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,260
It’s not a dream to have an annual salary of one million in the future

17
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:30,090
Zhang Tong has spent his whole life

18
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:32,190
I heard everyone’s comments, but Zhang Tong didn’t

19
00:00:32,190 --> 00:00:35,690
Back then, you refused to help me cheat in the exam room, but I am a kind-hearted person and don’t care about you.

20
00:00:35,690 --> 00:00:38,290
Seeing that your price has dropped and you have become a fruit seller, I am willing to give you a hand

21
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:39,690
give me a hand

22
00:00:39,690 --> 00:00:42,690
Our company's logistics department happens to be short of a cleaner to sweep the floors. Come here.

23
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:44,890
For the sake of old classmates, I'll let you in.

24
00:00:44,890 --> 00:00:46,090
The monthly salary will definitely satisfy you

25
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:47,490
How can I spend three thousand yuan a month?

26
00:00:47,490 --> 00:00:50,090
No better than you selling rotten fruit in the wind and sun

27
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:52,490
You should keep such a good position
